{
  "name": "One with the Waves",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You no longer have need for weapons. You learn to throw your weight around with the might of the waves and your hands become instruments of Gargan's will - and with that, his crushing, inescapable grasp. You can roll a d8 in place of the normal damage of your Unarmed Strike. If you have both hands free or are attacking a target that you have Grappled, this die changes to a d12.</p><p>Additionally, you gain a Swim Speed equal to your Speed. If you already have a Swim Speed, that Swim Speed instead increases by 30 feet.</p>",
